{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:73ddf0bcf40f4e1f74e3d7c3aa12b556dc0ca2863ff2b79758976681daf05880",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72eff6c067a2d62a589e2db5aeb69f81108392b4e4f0fc41550b6347219a4bb",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a727df4ffe84e7d19ac5a5225123de5d1ee6e890dd0c6aea2702ee88414b4e",
      "text": "消防员时期的伙伴好像看了\n昨天的播出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba15d48b15c6e7fd12970be3d0dbed9475b193f1638721d2239e7203337ceea0",
      "text": "他夸我很适合那个角色呢！\n一开始我还觉得自己跟那个角色不是同一类型的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733c289b6f32a4050063584de850056076f6a36cb6955c9643083221153d4e3a",
      "text": "太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc4bb556ed0ffbaec25410e7a162d62f57e9464f4883de6337e7c9e0d1e071ee",
      "text": "向制作人请教角色塑造的时候，\n你对我说了好多鼓励的话对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f77f38cb25d26bf4b18e66b47a767a6a52fbf915e22ede65ed52ef75be95c82",
      "text": "多亏了那些话，我自己也开始觉得这个角色\n说不定意外地挺适合我的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e560365b2281e1933989b1734266d40eea60ac3163758192ad3ef08f2811e4d5",
      "text": "创真只是不擅长用语言表达，\n其实是个非常热血的家伙对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f06b153c0b44cc52c1be145f6466a05bdfbc02246ac9726a39a988d913f9542c",
      "text": "反复读了好多次剧本，那家伙的\n那一面就越来越清晰地浮现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c1be9940c450ea2e25044dd9f2bef9d6fbc096aeab4deba925b6759b5ab89fd",
      "text": "我注意到了我们身上其实有好多\n可以产生共鸣的地方！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24df06c81b58faa62e18115ab764d9c47bc6694074a507d7ecb15df792253753",
      "text": "真是绝配的角色分配呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f6b69276c1b5c976504245afd2e715c03c3f16340da9b8d8190d7002928d118",
      "text": "展现出了龙先生独有的\n风采呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7800150026bfc51bdd5ae1670f3556a6b80c92e299407b0016789aa622be227",
      "text": "拍摄前的我可能还会否认……\n但现在的话，我完全可以肯定地这么说了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc3ca5924e347b480634d4cb9302eb0aedbb9f01adb7aa43daabb35b015fc359",
      "text": "我独有的风采，吗……！看了电视剧的大家\n要是也能这么觉得，我就很高兴啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:836fe2130433c1f60714ba960104403f16879a7927650c888b5cf46f1e532dab",
      "text": "能和制作人聊聊角色塑造的事\n真是太好了。真的很感谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_402_2_4_015_02_09_a:2_4_015_02_09_a:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6af78e6fc43fa949af9cb452a120092a5ac4b97b8afae5f13cfa30af402659e",
      "text": "下一份工作我也会保持这个状态加油的，今后也\n请多关照啦！那就明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
